text = "Low: best performance — 75% render scale, shadows off, no grass tufts, procedural sky, 30 FPS cap (picked automatically on phones and basic laptops). Medium: balanced — full resolution, HDRI sky, light shadows, 60 FPS. High: full quality — bloom, deep shadows. Custom: mix and match. Trees are always drawn at full detail."

